<h3 id="the-pretty-mode">The pretty mode</h3>

<p>Crank the speed up and turn on liquid cells. The squares melt into overlapping soft blobs and the whole board starts looking less like a cellular automaton and more like something you leave running on the desk while you think.</p>

<p>I keep catching myself watching it for several minutes at a time, which is either a glowing review or a concerning use of spare attention. Possibly both.</p>

