<h3 id="why-bother-charging">Why bother charging</h3>

<p>Mostly because $0.99 is a very small gate that says &ldquo;this is a finished little thing,&rdquo; not a free novelty that I feel obligated to support forever. If nobody buys it, I still get the Watch face-adjacent zen garden I wanted. If a handful of people do, neat.</p>

<p>Again: if you want to poke at it without buying, <a href="https://testflight.apple.com/join/KGh2r6zT">join the public TestFlight</a>. If you want to own it, grab it for a US buck from the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gollygee/id6809184721">App Store</a>.</p>

